# Golden chord script: played on every style in src/golden.rs. Grammar: README.md.
# Changing this file changes every snapshot; regenerate them in the same commit.

# Intro A, started by the first chord (Sync Start), then Main A.
[IntroA] | C | G7 |
| C | Am | Dm7 | G7 |
# Four-note qualities and on-bass chords.
| Cmaj7 | Am7 | Fmaj7 | Fm6 |
| C/E | Ebdim7 | Dm7 G7 | Caug - - [MainB] - |
# Fill into Main B: sus chords, 1+5, half-diminished, a descending bass.
| Csus4 C | Asus2 A | C5 | Bm7b5 E7 |
| Am | Am/G | F#m7b5 | Fmaj7 - - [Break] - |
# Break, then Main C with tensions.
| E7sus4 E7 | Am - - [MainC] - |
| A7 | D9 | Gm | C7b9 |
| Fm | Bb13 | Ebmaj7 | Ab7#11 - - [MainD] - |
# Main D: minor-major, augmented seventh, diminished, altered dominants, slash over the fifth.
| Dbmaj7 | CmMaj7 | Cdim | G7#5 |
| Cm(add9) | Ab7 | G7#9 | C/G - - [EndingA] - |
# Ending A, then let it run out.
| C | - | - | - |
